{"id": "107-2-F-021", "year": 107, "session": 2, "subject": "F", "number": 21, "stem": "在門控心肌灌注造影的影像上若看到「左心室下壁」有固定性灌注缺損（fixed perfusion defect ），但門控 \n功能分析上該區域卻呈現正常的心壁運動（wall motion ）與增厚（wall thickening ），這種缺損應該是下列 \n何種假影所造成？", "options": {"A": "乳房衰減假影（breast attenuation artifact ）", "B": "橫膈衰減假影（diaphragm attenuation artifact ）", "C": "移動假影（motion artifact ）", "D": "散射假影（scatter artifact ）"}, "answer": "B", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/107_2/66_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T09:17:54+00:00", "needs_review": false}
